// name :
"P976603146" "Burden of the Past (Dark Astoria Chapter 1)"
// flashbackteamrequiresfailedtext :
"P4080437062" "<color orange>You and everyone on your team must be a VIP and have completed Heather Townshend's story arc to run this arc.</color>"
// teamrequiresfailedtext :
"P3934466014" "<color orange>You and everyone on your team must be a VIP to run Dark Astoria content.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - TheKnivesofVengeance 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1852913593" "Knives of Vengeance"
// DetailString :
"P1770022517" "The cave you delved into contained more than you could've imagined. You watched as a member of the Knives of Artemis was swallowed by some sort of monstrous... mouth, after she was proclaiming that the world was doomed. She told you that the Knives of Artemis had transformed into these monsters called the Knives of Vengeance.<br><br>You were then attacked by one of their assassins, who spoke of others that they had to deal with. Is this the result of the monster that has awakened within Dark Astoria?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - KnowTalons 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P726238444" "The Talons of Vengeance"
// DetailString :
"P647037636" "You were able to deduce from your experiences in First Ward that the Talons of Vengeance are somehow involved in the morphing of the Knives of Artemis. However, the question still remains, why would they do this?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - KoVClue1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2394602911" "Purpose of Vengeance"
// DetailString :
"P3670064089" "You defeated one of the monstrous women in the Knives of Vengeance and tried to get information out of her. However, the woman's eyes glazed over before dying seconds after you defeated her.<br><br>It seems that the Knives of Vengeance have only one purpose, and if they are defeated, then their purpose is used up."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - KoVClue2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1554926964" "Too Much to Do"
// DetailString :
"P1863343322" "The Knives of Vengeance that you fought said something about there being too much work for them to do. Have they been created specifically to bear someone else's burden?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - KoVClue3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P887898602" "The City of Punishment"
// DetailString :
"P3223050826" "You defeated one of the leaders of the Knives of Vengeance, who mentioned that people seem to be summoned to Dark Astoria to pay for their sins. She specifically mentioned Kadabra Kill, Sigil's husband.<br><br>Are the Knives of Vengeance focusing on Dark Astoria because of this?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Peaceful 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3159818806" "Peaceful Resolution"
// DetailString :
"P3364022669" "You were able to end things peacefully with Huab Tais, though he warned you that the rest of the Tsoo would not be so willing to settle things in the same manner."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Tsoo1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P4227233768" "Summoning Components"
// DetailString :
"P2034025141" "You found several items within one of the Tsoo chests in their warehouse. It contains several very rare summoning components, something you found out from a dossier that was located on the chest. They mention that the components are used for summoning some sort of being into this world, but it does not specify who or what that being is."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Tsoo2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1937910855" "The Nature of Mot"
// DetailString :
"P1606860925" "You searched through documents that the Tsoo had regarding Mot and found some important information. Mot, it seems, is powered by death and suffering. The more death there is, the more Mot is empowered. The more anguish a person is in when they are killed, the more power Mot gains.<br><br>The Tsoo theorize that all of the wars that have been happening within Paragon and the Isles in this short amount of time have pushed Mot to fully re-awaken.<br><br>Their most recent research deals in what happens when a person is 'absorbed' by Mot. The Tsoo believe now that Mot is awake, he has the ability to absorb those who have become weakened, but their research is still inconclusive."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Tsoo3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3074019397" "The Power of Gods"
// DetailString :
"P3220661041" "You found a book entitled, 'The Power of Gods' within the Tsoo warehouse. You read it over to see that it contains several proposals on how one could absorb the power of gods or god-like entities. All of them detail rituals that would take years to gather the components for.<br><br>It's safe to assume that the Tsoo are looking into a way to not only kill Mot, but to also take his power for themselves!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - AncestralWarden 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P149157310" "The Tsoo Will Prevail"
// DetailString :
"P2123222693" "You defeated the Ancestral Warden within the Tsoo's warehouse. Before he collapsed, he warned you that no matter what, the Tsoo and Tub Ci shall prevail. They have been working on their plans for years, and they will finally be rewarded for all of the sacrifices they've made in the fight against Mot."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - SigilSaved 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3453550987" "Sigil Saved"
// DetailString :
"P3283153826" "You chose to let Kadabra Kill be killed by the Knives of Vengeance, ensuring that his wife, Sigil, would live."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - BothSaved 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2959975942" "Kadabra Kill and Sigil Saved"
// DetailString :
"P3392942575" "You fought against the might of the Knives of Vengeance and emerged victorious, saving both Kadabra Kill and Sigil."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - SL9_JamesMason 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P1813184824" "Broken Assassin Visor"
// tDetailString :
"P2483442512" "You recovered the visor of a member of the Knives of Artemis. They must have tossed it off while trying to fight against the Knives of Vengeance. It reminds you of an experience called...<br><br><b>Burden of the Past</b><br><br>You found yourself within Dark Astoria, which was now transformed into an even more nightmarish planescape. You discovered that the Knives of Artemis had been transformed into a monstrous group called the Knives of Vengeance and were now wreaking havoc in the area.<br><br>You worked with a woman named Heather Townshend to find out more information about the Knives of Vengeance and what they were about, while also encountering other groups who were at play withn the cursed city, namely the Tsoo and Arachnos.<br><br>In the end, you were faced with a situation of trying to save Sigil and Kadabra Kill. Did you choose to save them, or were their lives not part of your plan of discovering what was at stake within Dark Astoria?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Sigil 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page WadeArcComplete Text :
"P3336528880" "<color orange>Sigil glares at you.</color><br><br>You! I remember you all too well, {HeroName}. Are you still just a lackey for Darrin Wade, even with all of your power, or have you broken away and become your own {Hero.gender=male man|woman}?<br><br>Or are you working for whatever creature is trying to destroy the world?"
// Answer Text :
"P3819618826" "That's in the past. I'm here to stop whatever is happening."
// Answer Text :
"P2352772422" "Look, Sigil, I'm sorry for what happened in the past."
// Page PageAChoice1 Text :
"P2093937870" "You're here to stop what's happening? Hrmph... I suppose stranger things have happened.<br><br>My husband and I have been investigating what's going on. Have you seen them in the streets? The monstrous beings that are terrorizing the area along with the Banished Pantheon."
// Answer Text :
"P2595115162" "What about them?"
// Page PageAChoice3 Text :
"P3391499446" "What? You're sorry? For attacking my husband and I? For breaking in to the Midnighter's mansion? For working with Darrin Wade?"
// Answer Text :
"P2726058195" "That would be it, yes. I'm here to help now with what's happening."
// Page PageAChoice1Part2 Text :
"P3058057208" "We think they might be members of the <color yellow>Knives of Artemis</color>, but transformed. They might have something to do with all of this, but we can't be sure.<br><br>I was going to try to push forward through these caverns; there's a member of the group that ran into here. However, there's just too many for me to take on alone.<br><br>If you're serious about trying to stop this, {HeroName}, then I would try to track down that woman and see what she knows. In the meantime, I'm going to meet back with my husband and tell him that we have your help, even if it is... unusual."
// Answer Text :
"P2977903288" "Alright, I'll do that."
// Page PageAChoice3Part2 Text :
"P2059856631" ""<color orange>Sigil stares at you for a few moments before sighing.</color><br><br>I'm suspicious, but I'll give you a chance, {HeroName}. My husband and I have been investigating what's going on. Have you seen them in the streets? The monstrous beings that are terrorizing the area along with the Banished Pantheon. We think they might be members of the <color yellow>Knives of Artemis</color>, but transformed. They might have something to do with all of this, but we can't be sure.<br><br>I was going to try to push forward through these caverns; there's a member of the group that ran into here. However, there's just too many for me to take on alone.<br><br>If you're serious about trying to stop this, {HeroName}, then I would try to track down that woman and see what she knows. In the meantime, I'm going to meet back with my husband and tell him that we have your help, even if it is... unusual."
// Page Villain Text :
"P4117584353" "Stay back, {HeroName}! Even if you are an Incarnate, I will <i>not</i> hesitate to attack you!<br><br>I'll make sure you are destroyed with these monsters if you intend to help them!"
// Answer Text :
"P446726847" "Calm down. I'm here to stop whatever is happening."
// Answer Text :
"P1280545508" "Do you really think you have a chance against an Incarnate?"
// Page PageBChoice2 Text :
"P331530714" "Maybe I don't, but I'm not one to just lay down and let myself be defeated, {HeroName}.<br><br>If you want to fight me while all of this chaos is happening, then so be it. My husband will continue what I've started if I fall here."
// Answer Text :
"P2547399314" "Perhaps we'll find that out later. For now, I'm here to stop whatever is happening."
// Page PageBChoice2Part2 Text :
"P2251741062" "<color orange>Sigil stares at you for a few moments before sighing.</color><br><br>I'd rather not do this, but we need all the help we can get, even <i>your</i> help. My husband and I have been investigating what's going on. Have you seen them in the streets? The monstrous beings that are terrorizing the area along with the Banished Pantheon. We think they might be members of the <color yellow>Knives of Artemis</color>, but transformed. They might have something to do with all of this, but we can't be sure.<br><br>I was going to try to push forward through these caverns; there's a member of the group that ran into here. However, there's just too many for me to take on alone.<br><br>If you're serious about trying to stop this, {HeroName}, then I would try to track down that woman and see what she knows. In the meantime, I'm going to meet back with my husband and tell him that we have your help, even if it is... unusual."
// Page Close Text :
"P856364347" ""
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"
// Page Regular Text :
"P1046141421" "Oh, {HeroName}, you are a sight for sore eyes! My husband and I were hoping that someone else would show up to help us, but we never imagined it would be <i>you</i>!<br><br>Montague has asked that the rest of the Midnight Squad stay out of the affairs in Astoria for the moment. We can't risk losing any more members to this until we know more about what's going on."
// Answer Text :
"P930249754" "Understandable. What's the situation here?"
// Answer Text :
"P2480614527" "Do you know what happened to the missing supergroup?"
// Page PageCChoice1 Text :
"P3240417529" "My husband and I have been investigating what's going on. Have you seen them in the streets? The monstrous beings that are terrorizing the area along with the Banished Pantheon. We think they might be members of the <color yellow>Knives of Artemis</color>, but transformed. They might have something to do with all of this, but we can't be sure.<br><br>I was going to try to push forward through these caverns; there's a member of the group that ran into here. However, there's just too many for me to take on alone.<br><br>If you're serious about trying to stop this, {HeroName}, then I would try to track down that woman and see what she knows. In the meantime, I'm going to meet back with my husband and tell him that we have your help."
// Answer Text :
"P3942266438" "Alright, I'll take care of things here."
// Page Supergroup Text :
"P2169370839" "We encountered a member from a supergroup that was called here. He mentioned how the rest of his group was lost to the city.<br><br>The man looked like a shade of himself. My husband told him that we could help him, but he refused, saying something about being beyond help, how he couldn't bear the burden any more. He ran off around a corner. We heard a scream and chased after him. He was gone, {HeroName}.<br><br>During our time here, we've seen a few supers, and even a detective, but none of them stayed still long enough for us to talk with them."
// Answer Text :
"P927469631" "Got it. What else can you tell me about the situation here?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Hand 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1646658601" "<color orange>You see a member of the Knives of Artemis, surrounded by what appears to be former members of the Knives of Artemis. They look normal, at first glance, but upon closer inspection you can see monstrous details that set these women apart.<br><br>The member of the Knives of Artemis looks worn out, tiredly grasping onto her blade, the edge of it looking dull from too much use.</color><br><br>{HeroName}, {Hero.type=hero the famous hero.|the infamous villain.} I remember receiving many hits to kill you.<br><br>That's all changed now, however. The end is here, and we're all witnesses to the collapse of our world. They're all gone, now, beyond my grasp. I had to kill them, put them out of their misery."
// Answer Text :
"P2143939433" "What's going on here? Who are these monsters?"
// Page Monsters Text :
"P1528122214" "These were my sisters. Something happened to our inner circle, but I do not know what.<br><br>They chose to be transformed, to become something higher, as they say. I do not know who or what caused this... I only know that they've broken from the organization. They call themselves the <color red>Knives of Vengeance</color>. They tried to get me to join them, but I refused.<br><br>They called me traitor and chased me down. They wanted to kill me, {HeroName}, but I killed them first. We were trained not to care for the deaths of our fellow assassins, but nothing prepared me for killing them when they've become... monsters."
// Answer Text :
"P625035115" "Why do you say it's the end of times?"
// Page EndofTimes Text :
"P729965303" "The organization is gone, {HeroName}. The monster within Astoria is awakened. Forces of nature beyond our comprehension attack us from every side.<br><br>I kill five, ten more show up... there's no end to this.  My hands are covered with the blood of my sisters, twisted and disfigured.<br><br>I can't go on any further, {HeroName}. There's no hope left for this world, don't you see?<br><br><color orange>You see a strange presence beginning to gather around the Knives of Artemis assassin...</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P34884239" "What the...?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Heather 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1207995451" "{HeroName}, what did you find out?<br><br><color orange>You explain to Heather what happened in the caves beneath Dark Astoria.</color><br><br>That's... that's horrible. I didn't even know about these Knives of Artemis until today... but that must've been the assassin I had seen. You said she was swallowed by some sort of <i>mouth</i>? I wonder... was it because she gave up hope? I don't know, it's a crazy theory.<br><br>Do you have any idea what caused these women to transform?"
// Answer Text :
"P1939162952" "No, not in the slightest."
// Answer Text :
"P700049952" "I have a feeling it's a group called the Talons of Vengeance."
// Page NoIdea Text :
"P3408776143" "Hrm, well, I think the most we can do at this point is to try and figure out more about why this woman was eaten.<br><br>If we find out more about the power at work here, we can stand a chance at stopping it."
// Answer Text :
"P805189348" "I'm all ears if you have an idea."
// Page Talons Text :
"P1220504650" "The Talons of what?<br><br><color orange>You explain to Heather your experience in First Ward with the Talons of Vengeance and you believe they're somehow connected with the Knives of Vengeance, down to the name and motives.</color><br><br>So... they're out seeking some sort of perverse justice? In a place like Dark Astoria, they're bound to find plenty to label as guilty, {Hero.type=hero not that you need to worry yourself,|especially someone like you,} {HeroName}.<br><br>So, we know the Talons of Vengeance are somehow involved, but what does that have to do with that mouth that devoured that woman? We need to find out more about that power if we stand a chance at stopping it."
// Answer Text :
"P3392116176" "I've told you everything I know. Anything on your end?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2035752316" "I'll be completely blunt, {HeroName}. I don't know a lot about what's going on. However, Kadabra Kill and Sigil seemed to at least have an idea of what to do first.<br><br>They told me that they would check back periodically with me. Sigil stated that they were trying to find out what was going on with those monsters I mentioned to you, the ones who were attacking the assassins.<br><br>Kadabra Kill mentioned that they had tracked some of them down to a nearby cave system."
// AcceptString :
"P3873506911" "So if I find Kadabra Kill and Sigil, I'll find some answers."
// SendOffString :
"P3063421084" "Yes, I would assume as much. {Hero.type=Hero They'll be happy to have someone like yourself on their side, that's for sure.|You'll have to convince them you're not there to attack them, though, given your reputation.}<br><br>I'm going to be staying here to see if I can find anyone else who is wandering within Dark Astoria. Before you came along, I saw several other individuals running through the streets. I tried to call out to them, but they could not hear me, and I could not risk leaving this safe area.<br><br>{Hero.type=Hero I'd be on the lookout yourself for any missing supers in your time here.|If you care, I would be on the lookout for any missing supers while you're here.}"
// TaskTitle :
"P2713173798" "<color deepskyblue>Burden of the Past</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3575590519" "<color deepskyblue>Part One: Vengeance</color>"

