// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Kadabra 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1053541346" "No... Kadabra... why did you think that you caused me pain?! I chose all of this... it wasn't your place to decide that it wasn't right!"
// Answer Text :
"P2251518801" "What did he mean when he talked about pain?"
// Answer Text :
"P2107680741" "Who's this Mot, and what does he have to do with the Pantheon?"
// Page Pain Text :
"P3632770908" "When we were young, we had gotten into some... Trouble. I won't bother with the details, but in the end, I <i>chose</i> to give up my soul so that Kadabra would keep his.<br><br>He and I have been seeking a way to recover my soul ever since. I suppose these Knives of Vengeance believe that Kadabra somehow cheated, that he should have been the one to have his soul taken. They seem to think that they're doing <i>me</i> a favor in all of this, but I chose for this to happen.<br><br>I would do anything to help my husband, and he anything for me. But now it seems the darkness here has twisted his mind, making him believe that he was in the wrong."
// Answer Text :
"P2729797761" "The darkness - Mot? What does he have to do with the Pantheon?"
// Page Mot Text :
"P2995741956" "I've only heard rumors, nothing substantial. There may be others who can help you, though.<br><br>The <color yellow>Tsoo</color> have been fighting in Dark Astoria for years. If anyone would have information about Mot, it would be them.<br><br>I need to recover myself and find my husband, {HeroName}. I can't let him be taken by these women or this city. If I need your help, I will let that woman, Heather, know. {Hero.type=hero I know we can count on you to help us in our time of need.|I'm taking a gamble in trusting someone like you, I hope you know that.}"
// Answer Text :
"P4105472113" "Wait, what is it that your husband did?"
// Answer Text :
"P1929004856" "Alright, I'll look into the Tsoo."
// Answer Text :
"P2634150014" "Alright, I'm going to look into the Tsoo."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Detective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page KnowHopp Text :
"P3701453085" "No time to talk, {HeroName}. I've got business I need to handle in this city. Name's Detective Hopp, though. Maybe we'll run into each other again.<br><br><color orange>Detective Hopp runs off, but you remember that Captain Nolan mentioned he was one of the officers sent to investigate the suicide cases. It looks like he's alive and well, for the time being.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2385719541" "(Leave)"
// Page Villain Text :
"P2645581392" "No time to talk to someone like you, {HeroName}, I've got bigger fish to fry.<br><br><color orange>The detective runs off, though you notice a strange look in his eyes, as if there's one singular thing that he's hunting for in this place.</color>"
// Page Regular Text :
"P3815999757" "No time to talk, {HeroName}. I've got business I need to handle in this city. Name's Detective Hopp, though. Maybe we'll run into each other again."
// Answer Text :
"P1443913718" "Try again."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3997738198" "The only idea I have still lies with Kadabra Kill and Sigil. Something... bizarre happened while you were gone, {HeroName}.<br><br>Kadabra Kill approached me, without his wife. There was something  different in his voice, a sort of... hopelessness in his tone. Sort of how that woman was talking to you. He told me that he was going to investigate a nearby office for clues towards the nature of the monstrous women and the beast that had awakened.<br><br>However, he didn't seem all too convinced that he would find anything."
// AcceptString :
"P1823688535" "Did Sigil follow him?"
// SendOffString :
"P2193980341" "Yes, she ran off right away when I told her what happened. She seemed to have an idea of what might've been going on. I tried to follow her, but, well, I'm just a plain civilian. I'm not going to risk leaving these runes.<br><br><color orange>Heather sighs, rubbing the bridge of her nose.</color><br><br>I'm just an architect, {HeroName}, I was never supposed to be involved in something big like this. I know it's not much to go on, but I think you can find something else out if you go to this building."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P966311313" "Investigate the Dark Astoria Building"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4183463835" "Be careful, {HeroName}. Dark Astoria has no safe havens outside of these runes."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P4199976851" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two: No Escape</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4062450197" "You saw winged creatures flying around the building before you entered it, like sharks circling in on their prey.<br><br>The Knives of Vengeance must be after Kadabra Kill and Sigil, but are they somehow controlling the power that <i>devoured</i> the Knives of Artemis assassin?"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P644219074" "Find Sigil and Kadabra Kill"
