"P2714396131" "You will all regret this mistake. Ice Mistral, Mu'Vorkin, we leave."
// Script Variable NPC_DIALOG_NAME :
"P3033318358" "Ice Mistral"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P177571957" "<em frustrated>But we can TAKE him! Come on, I'll break him into a million pieces!"
// Script Variable NPC_DIALOG_NAME :
"P675197938" "Mu'Vorkin"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3828142333" "Scirocco has spoken. We leave."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2813255896" "Hua Tov"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P490246910" "Do not return! ... What is this? Now {HeroName} is here as well?"
// Script Variable PET_NAME :
"P631301169" "Madame Bellerose"
// Script Variable PET_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1717950666" "You're dealing with an incarnate, lovelies. Do you think you can really win?"
// Script Variable PET_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P768416313" "Hrm, {HeroName}, wasn't it? I'll give you the honor, this time."
// Script Variable SayOnRescue :
"P1140558209" "This was quite unexpected, {HeroName}. What are you doing here?"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P434929807" "Sky Fall"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3123670239" "I do not know how you ended up here, but we will make sure you do not get out alive!"
